  "releaseNotes": "Correctness fix for atomizing nodes read back from a host's lazy/streamed node store (null precomputed string value, on-demand children). Implicit atomization in fn:number/fn:data/the type constructors, plus contains/starts-with/ends-with/string-join/distinct-values/deep-equal/fn:id/upper-case/lower-case and computed-element content, now compute an element's string value through the execution context's node provider instead of seeing an empty string. Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.1.9. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
